---
import { links } from '../lib/links.js';
---
<div class="pp-grid">
  <article class="pp-card">
    <div class="pp-name">Renegade Community</div>
    <div class="pp-price"><strong>Free</strong></div>
    <p class="pp-pitch">Come steal our ideas.</p>
    <p class="pp-desc">For anyone who wants to look around, learn what's working and meet other business owners first.</p>
    <ul class="p-checks">
      <li>Live Power Hours every week</li>
      <li>Playbooks and templates</li>
      <li>New tools and experiments we're testing</li>
      <li>Business owners figuring it out with you</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="p-btn p-btn-secondary p-btn-block pp-cta" href={links.community}>Join free</a>
  </article>

  <article class="pp-card is-featured">
    <span class="pp-badge">Start here</span>
    <div class="pp-name">Renegade CRM</div>
    <div class="pp-price"><strong>$99</strong><span>/ month</span></div>
    <p class="pp-pitch">Put the machine in place.</p>
    <p class="pp-desc">The software that runs your marketing, plus the playbooks that tell you exactly what to turn on first.</p>
    <ul class="p-checks">
      <li>CRM, contacts and pipelines</li>
      <li>Email and text from one inbox</li>
      <li>Automated follow-up for every lead</li>
      <li>Calendars and online booking</li>
      <li>Review and referral requests</li>
      <li>Funnels, social scheduling and AI tools</li>
      <li>Renegade playbooks to set it all up</li>
      <li>Everything in Community</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="p-btn p-btn-primary p-btn-block pp-cta" href={links.crmMonthly} rel="noopener">Start for $99/mo</a>
    <span class="pp-alt">Or <a href={links.crmAnnual} rel="noopener">pay $999 for the year</a> and save $189.</span>
  </article>

  <article class="pp-card">
    <div class="pp-name">Renegade Academy</div>
    <div class="pp-price"><strong>$199</strong><span>/ month</span></div>
    <p class="pp-pitch">Build it with us.</p>
    <p class="pp-desc">The same system, with us in the room. Live, step-by-step help building it into your actual business.</p>
    <ul class="p-checks">
      <li>Everything in Renegade CRM</li>
      <li>Live weekly build sessions</li>
      <li>Step-by-step implementation tracks</li>
      <li>Strategy and troubleshooting help</li>
      <li>A small group building alongside you</li>
    </ul>
    <a class="p-btn p-btn-dark p-btn-block pp-cta" href="/academy">See the Academy</a>
  </article>
</div>
<p class="pp-help"><strong>Not sure which one?</strong> Most people should start with Renegade CRM. If you'd rather not build it alone, Academy is the same system with a coach and classmates. And if you're just curious, join the community and poke around for free.</p>
